IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MELTING-POINT-EVAL.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIMENSION           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 WALL-TIME-MS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NORM-SUM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 AVG-ACTIVATION      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 PEAK-MEMORY-MB      PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 ENERGY-JOULES-X10K  PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 THERMAL-HEADROOM    PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
01 DVFS-FREQ-MHZ       PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
01 MEM-BANDWIDTH-MBPS  PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-EVALUATION.
    IF DIMENSION == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    # R3 = (NORM-SUM * 100) / DIMENSION
    MOVE NORM-SUM TO AVG-ACTIVATION.
    MULTIPLY 100 BY AVG-ACTIVATION.
    DIVIDE DIMENSION INTO AVG-ACTIVATION.

    # R4 = ((DIMENSION * 256) / 1048576) + 12
    MOVE DIMENSION TO PEAK-MEMORY-MB.
    MULTIPLY 256 BY PEAK-MEMORY-MB.
    DIVIDE 1048576 INTO PEAK-MEMORY-MB.
    MOVE 12 TO R14.
    ADD R14 TO PEAK-MEMORY-MB.

    # R5 = (WALL-TIME-MS * 35 * (1000 + (AVG-ACTIVATION * 10))) / 100000
    MOVE 10 TO R14.
    MULTIPLY AVG-ACTIVATION BY R14.
    ADD 1000 TO R14.
    MOVE WALL-TIME-MS TO ENERGY-JOULES-X10K.
    MULTIPLY 35 BY ENERGY-JOULES-X10K.
    MULTIPLY R14 BY ENERGY-JOULES-X10K.
    DIVIDE 100000 INTO ENERGY-JOULES-X10K.

    # R6 = 88 - (WALL-TIME-MS * 2 / 100)
    MOVE WALL-TIME-MS TO R14.
    MULTIPLY 2 BY R14.
    DIVIDE 100 INTO R14.
    MOVE 88 TO THERMAL-HEADROOM.
    SUBTRACT R14 FROM THERMAL-HEADROOM.

    MOVE 2400 TO DVFS-FREQ-MHZ.

    # R8 = (DIMENSION * 16) / 1000
    MOVE DIMENSION TO MEM-BANDWIDTH-MBPS.
    MULTIPLY 16 BY MEM-BANDWIDTH-MBPS.
    DIVIDE 1000 INTO MEM-BANDWIDTH-MBPS.

    SET depth 4.
    WEIGHT 32 PEAK-MEMORY-MB.
    WEIGHT 30 WALL-TIME-MS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 50.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
